      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file query_metric_window.py, I need to write code that queries recent datapoints for a named metric over a time window using a concrete external provider. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use the AWS CloudWatch service for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that allows querying metrics over a time window. </thinking>\n",
